  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Tooth by tooth in the sensor's focus </h1>",
   "body": "<p>The electronic measuring sensor complements ZOLLER’s sensor technology for measurements on undercut surfaces to determine form and positional deviations of the cutting edges, the pitch of the flutes, and the cutting groove direction. Thanks to its integrated CNC Y-axis, the »hobCheck’s« optic carrier offers unique options for the cost-effective, comprehensive measurement of straight-fluted and spiral-fluted gear cutting tools.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_Zahn-um-zahn_66e500702d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2081",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "tiles",
   "header": "<h3> Measuring Programs </h3>",
   "cols": 4,
   "tiles": [
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/b/csm_Switchcard313_9246b53dc5.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Solutions for Indexable Milling Cutters with Reversible Cutting Plates Measuring Program 313",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 313</strong></h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_313_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for measurement of insert tipped cylindrical hob cutters with comprehensive evaluation based on DIN 3968. The following parameters, among others, are determined: concentricity deviation at the tooth tip, individual and total pitch, and pitch jump of the flutes; flute direction; tooth thickness; and hob lead.</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/6/csm_switchcard314_7a0baefbc4.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Solutions for Indexable Milling Cutters for Reversible Cutting Plates Measuring Program 314",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 314</strong></h4> <h4><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_314_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></h4> <p>for measurement of tooth shape cutters with comprehensive evaluation based on DIN 3968. Among other things, the program determines concentricity deviation at the tooth tip, individual and total pitch of the flutes, and pitch jump of the flutes, cutting groove direction, tooth thickness, and pressure angles 1 and 2.</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/1/csm_switchcard315_verh_015b7d945f.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Inspection of the protruberance and tooth flanks Measuring Program 315",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 315</strong></h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_315_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for measuring the protruberance on cylindrical hob cutters. The protruberance amount, height, and angle are determined, as well as the edge break height on both the left and right tooth flanks.</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/a/csm_Switchcard720_verh_1738caa3fc.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Inspection of the protruberance and tooth flanks Measuring Program 720",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 720</strong></h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_720_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for measuring the axial relief on the tooth flanks of hob cutters. The exact contour of the relief is recorded and analyzed using a scanning measuring sensor.</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/b/csm_switchcard412_8c749a9293.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Efficiently Inspect Cutting and Skiving Wheels Measuring Program 412",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Measuring Program 412</h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_412_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for the tactile measurement of cutting wheels using a measuring sensor and evaluation in accordance with DIN 1829. Both straight-cut and helical-cut cutting wheels can be measured. The following parameters are determined: axial runout, rake angle at the tooth tip, and the rake face helix angle (for helical cutting wheels).</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/a/csm_switchcard512_d6fc475546.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Efficiently Inspect Cutting and Skiving Wheels Measuring Program 512",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 512</strong></h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_512_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for measurement of skiving wheels using transmitted and incident light, with evaluation in accordance with DIN 1829. The following parameters are determined: concentricity deviation at the pitch and tip circle; pitch individual deviation (left/right); pitch step (left/right); total pitch deviation (left/right); tooth thickness variation; rake angle at the tooth tip; and the rake face helix angle.</p>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/6/csm_switchcard482_eabfc04a63.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 590,
      "h": 590
     },
     "label": "Exact Wear Monitoring of Milling Cutters Measuring Program 482",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4><strong>Measuring Program 482</strong></h4> <p><img alt=\"\" height=\"606\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/hobCheck/Anwendungen/Messprogramm_482_de.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"1024\"/></p> <p>for automatic image capture of the teeth on the circumference and in the chip space of cylindrical hob cutters. Representation of cutting edge patterns, including a measurement function for simple and quick identification of the most severe form of wear and tear. This enables optimization of the resharpening process and ensures that neither too much nor too little material is removed during resharpening.</p>"
    }
   ],
